<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Just Jeans yr net profit up 11.5 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Just Jeans yr net profit up 11.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended July 27</p>
<p>		  (A$ million unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     14.11 vs  12.65</p>
<p>    Sales				   340.48 vs 315.95</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		5.00 vs  4.50</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     10.00 vs  9.00</p>
<p>    Tax					 8.38 vs  6.42</p>
<p>    Interest				  1.80 vs  1.82</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    8.49 vs  7.33</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    17.6  vs  15.8</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked  </p>
<p>Pay date Dec 9</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 27</p>
<p>NOTE: Just Jeans is a clothing retailer</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
